@namespace Aetheus.Front.Components.Shared
@* ADR-021 phase 4: grouped errors for a monitored app (fingerprint / type / message / count / seen).
   R-181: no Refresh button, the grid reloads on the AppTelemetryChanged push of the app's project.
   The grid is full height and remotely virtualized, like the Logs tab (recette R-358): it reads the
   groups from the API block by block as it scrolls, and its column sorts and header filters travel
   with each request, so they apply to every error group of the app and not to the loaded rows.
   Recette R2-011: the export is the grid's own bar under the table (Markdown and CSV), which reads every
   group the column filters select through ExportLoad; the button above the grid went. *@
@if (_loadFailed)
{
    <OmniAlert Severity="OmniSeverity.Danger" Class="omni-u-mb-sm">
        <OmniStack Orientation="OmniStackOrientation.Horizontal" Align="OmniAlignment.Center" Gap="OmniSpacing.Small">
            <OmniText Element="OmniTextElement.Paragraph" Class="omni-u-m-0">@L["LoadFailed"]</OmniText>
            <OmniButton Variant="OmniButtonVariant.Secondary" OnClick="@RetryAsync"><OmniIcon Name="OmniIconName.Refresh" /> <span>@L["Retry"]</span></OmniButton>
        </OmniStack>
    </OmniAlert>
}
@* A failed call is not "no errors yet": the alert above says so and the grid stays empty. *@
<AetheusDataGrid @ref="_grid" TItem="AppErrorEventDto" Data="@_errors" Count="@_total" IsLoading="@_loading"
                 LoadData="@LoadDataAsync" PageSize="@PageSize" Virtualize="@AetheusGrid.RemoteVirtualization"
                 VirtualData="@(() => new OmniDataGridResult<AppErrorEventDto>(_errors, _total))"
                 FullHeight="true" RowClick="@OpenErrorAsync"
                 EmptyText="@(_loadFailed ? string.Empty : L["NoErrorsYet"].Value)"
                 ShowFooterBar="true" ExportTitle="@ExportTitle"
                 ExportFields="@ExportFields" ExportFileName="@ExportFileName" ExportLoad="@LoadExportPageAsync"
                 OnExportError="@OnExportFailed">
    <Columns>
        <OmniDataGridColumn Frozen="true" TItem="AppErrorEventDto" Property="ExceptionType" Title="@L["ErrorType"]" Width="220px" Filterable="true" FilterType="OmniDataGridColumnFilterType.MultiSelect" FilterValues="@_exceptionTypes" FilterSearchable="true" />
        <OmniDataGridColumn TItem="AppErrorEventDto" Property="Message" Title="@L["Message"]" Filterable="true" ExportValue="@MessageExport">
            <Template Context="e">
                <span title="@e.Message">@e.Message</span>
                @if (!string.IsNullOrEmpty(e.TopFrame))
                {
                    <div class="omni-u-text-muted app-error-top-frame">@e.TopFrame</div>
                }
            </Template>
        </OmniDataGridColumn>
        <OmniDataGridColumn TItem="AppErrorEventDto" Property="OccurrenceCount" Title="@L["Occurrences"]" Width="120px" Filterable="true" FilterType="OmniDataGridColumnFilterType.Number" FilterOperators="@GridFilterText.NumberOperators" >
            <Template Context="e"><CountBadge Value="@e.OccurrenceCount" Variant="OmniTone.Danger" /></Template>
        </OmniDataGridColumn>
        <OmniDataGridColumn TItem="AppErrorEventDto" Property="FirstSeenAt" Title="@L["FirstSeen"]" Width="150px" FormatString="{0:g}" Filterable="true" FilterType="OmniDataGridColumnFilterType.DateRange" FilterIncludesTime="true" />
        <OmniDataGridColumn TItem="AppErrorEventDto" Property="LastSeenAt" Title="@L["LastSeen"]" Width="150px" FormatString="{0:g}" Filterable="true" FilterType="OmniDataGridColumnFilterType.DateRange" FilterIncludesTime="true" />
    </Columns>
</AetheusDataGrid>
